Under Road Hazard Protection, a covered set's Crestline rotation history earns tire-care points on a store replacement the holder authorizes in person. The rotations counted are the Crestline rotation services on the covered set's Tire Sets & Treadwear Limited Warranty history.

**Authorization tire-care points.** A covered set with two or more Crestline rotation services in the last 12 whole calendar months and its most recent rotation fewer than 6 whole months ago adds 3 points to the authorization coverage percentage; a set with at least one rotation in that period that has fewer than two of them or whose most recent rotation is 6 or more whole months ago adds 1 point; a set with no rotation in that period adds no authorization tire-care points.

**Combinations.**
- three rotations in the last 12 whole months, latest 2 months ago: 3 points;
- two rotations, latest 7 months ago: 1 point;
- one rotation, 3 months ago: 1 point;
- no rotation in the last 12 whole months: 0 points.
